---
# Test harnesses: the CHECK(cond, msg) macros stream `msg` on purpose
# (`"x = " << x`), so parenthesising it as macro-parentheses asks would not
# compile; and a check that reads an optional right after asserting it has a
# value is the test, not an unchecked access.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-macro-parentheses,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access
